---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { categories, getPosts } from '../lib/posts';
import { GITHUB_URL } from '../consts';
const posts = await getPosts();
const icons = { tech: 'code', papers: 'book', notes: 'pen' };
---
<aside class="sidebar" aria-label="블로그 둘러보기">
  <section class="sidebar-section"><h2 class="eyebrow">EXPLORE <span>주제별 기록</span></h2>
    <div class="topic-links">{Object.entries(categories).map(([key, category]) => <a href={`/category/${key}/`}><span class={`topic-icon ${key}`}><Icon name={icons[key as keyof typeof icons]}/></span><span>{category.label}</span><span class="topic-count">{posts.filter(p => p.data.category === key).length}</span><Icon name="right" size={15}/></a>)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="author-note"><div class="author-monogram">JY<span></span></div><h2>Jonghwan Yoon</h2><p>기술을 탐구하고, 논문을 읽고.<br/>배움의 과정을 차곡차곡 기록합니다.</p><a href="/about/">이 공간에 대하여 <Icon name="arrow" size={15}/></a><a class="author-github" href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Jonghwan Yoon GitHub (새 탭)"><Icon name="github" size={18}/></a></section>
  <a class="rss-note" href="/rss.xml"><Icon name="rss" size={18}/><span>새로운 기록을 RSS로 만나보세요</span><Icon name="arrow" size={14}/></a>
</aside>
